{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:11 2026-11-20 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:11 2026-11-20 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:11 2026-11-20 HKT</p><img alt=\"潘明輝與靚女馬主Michelle\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/23c60ecaa237e16fa90b3a0ded040221/2026-11/67eecf91-2d11-4395-95ac-32b59da41b35.jpg\"/><p>「極歡欣」靚女馬主Michelle容采玲和一班好朋友，日前特地準備蛋糕，為潘明輝補祝生日之餘，兼祝賀對方早前憑羅富全旗下的「幸運威龍」取勝，在港贏夠300場頭馬。容采玲鼓勵潘明輝繼續努力，祝福他的策騎事業可更上一層樓。</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d9390225e4e253f2d5d60b9aec6c0e47/2026-11/a12.jpg\"/><p>陳嘉甜<br/> </p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T07:44:01.748877+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":196,"images":2,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T07:11:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T10:57:34.292419+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T07:37:26.858339+00:00","content_hash":"be3b7892d51f1e06b126052533a7c7edcb65301d1318b51c7f514063b7690b79","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}